---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const crumbs = [{ label: 'Legal', href: '/legal/' }, { label: 'Accessibility', href: '/accessibility/' }];
---
<PageLayout
  title="Accessibility"
  metaTitle="Accessibility Statement"
  description="Club Pamoja's commitment to an accessible website, the standard we work toward, and how to report a barrier."
  eyebrow="Legal"
  lede="Club Pamoja wants everyone in our community to be able to use this website."
  breadcrumbs={crumbs}
  cta={false}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--prose prose">
      <h2>Our standard</h2>
      <p>This website is designed and built to follow the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.</p>
      <h2>What we have done</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Semantic structure with landmarks and an ordered heading hierarchy</li>
        <li>Full keyboard navigation, including menus and question lists, with visible focus indicators</li>
        <li>A “Skip to main content” link on every page</li>
        <li>Text and interface colours chosen to meet AA contrast ratios</li>
        <li>Respect for your device’s reduced-motion setting</li>
        <li>Text alternatives for meaningful images</li>
        <li>Layouts that reflow at 400% zoom without horizontal scrolling</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Known limitations</h2>
      <p>The membership application and member portal are separate systems and may differ in accessibility from this website.</p>
      <h2>Report a barrier</h2>
      <p>If something on this website is hard to use, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> and tell us the page and what happened. We will do our best to provide the information in another way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
